
"smart_sources:2026-06-23 - 'The Queer Face of War' chronicles hardships for Ukraine’s LGBTQ+ community during war (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607081726).md": {"path":"2026-06-23 - 'The Queer Face of War' chronicles hardships for Ukraine’s LGBTQ+ community during war (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607081726).md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"zdn3wu","at":1785795033228},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1783553212877,"size":5840,"at":1785795033322,"hash":"zdn3wu"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,13],"##Read the Full Transcript":[14,50],"##Read the Full Transcript#{1}":[16,50]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Mike Fritz","target":"Mike Fritz","line":5},{"title":"Audio","target":"#audio","line":10},{"title":"Transcript","target":"#transcript","line":10}],"metadata":{"title":"'The Queer Face of War' chronicles hardships for Ukraine’s LGBTQ+ community during war","source":"https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/the-queer-face-of-war-chronicles-hardships-for-ukraines-lgbtq-community-during-war?mc_cid=4fd96cfc6b&mc_eid=3d9119f76a","author":["[[Mike Fritz]]"],"published":"2026-06-23","created":"2026-07-07","description":"It’s been more than four years since Russia launched a full-scale invasion of Ukraine. While war has impacted the lives of nearly all Ukrainians, life has been especially challenging for members of the LGBTQ+ community. Author and photojournalist J. Lester Feder’s book chronicles some of those lives. Amna Nawaz sat down with Feder to discuss \"The Queer Face of War.\""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},